#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:2
msgid "Install the Mattermost iOS mobile app"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:7
msgid ""
"Take Mattermost wherever you go by `installing the Mattermost mobile app "
"<https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mattermost/id1257222717>`_ on your iOS "
"mobile device running iOS 12.1 or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:9
msgid "On your device, visit the App Store."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:10
msgid "Search for \"Mattermost\" and select **GET** to download the app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:11
msgid ""
"Enter your Apple ID Password or use Face or Touch ID to proceed with the "
"installation. You may also be asked to provide an Apple Verification Code"
" received through text/phone call, login notification, or **Settings** on"
" your trusted device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:12
msgid "Open the Mattermost app and tap **Sign in** below the **Next** button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:13
msgid ""
"On the next screen, tap **Allow** when prompted to approve notifications "
"for the Mattermost app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:14
msgid "Now follow the steps below to log in:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Enter Server URL:** This is the web address you go to when you want to "
"access Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Display Name:** This is a name for your server so that you can identify"
" it in case you have multiple servers set up in your app. Tap **Connect**"
" to continue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:18
msgid ""
"Enter your credentials as specified by your Mattermost system admin in "
"the next screen. Tap **Log in**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:22
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`access your workspace </end-user-guide/access/access-your-"
"workspace>` documentation for additional details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/access/install-ios-app.rst:23
msgid ""
"You can set up multi-factor authentication for Mattermost if your system "
"admin has :ref:`enabled your ability to do so <administration-"
"guide/configure/authentication-configuration-settings:enable multi-factor"
" authentication>`. See the :doc:`manage security preferences </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-security-preferences>` documentation for "
"details."
msgstr ""

